{"unit_id":"tag:0214:prose-0005","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n关于大景（sites）的定义的动机和解释，见定义<REF_0001>之后的注记。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n在继续引入大平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）景（site）（属于概形（scheme）<MATH_0001>）之前，我们指出，大平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）景（site）<MATH_0002>上的拓扑（topology）在某种意义上由平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）拓扑（topology）诱导，后者定义在所有概形（schemes）的范畴（category）上。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0003>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"景","context":"大景定义，待决"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"相对大景限定，待决"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"大景，待决"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基概形，待决"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"大景限定，待决"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"诱导拓扑，待决"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0003>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"源拓扑限定，待决"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"源范畴对象，待决"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"概形范畴，待决"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:03WW:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个大平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）景（site），如定义<REF_0001>中所述。设<MATH_0002>。设<MATH_0003>是任意平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）覆盖（covering），它覆盖<MATH_0004>。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 存在覆盖（covering）<MATH_0005>，它是<MATH_0006>在景（site）<MATH_0007>中的覆盖，且加细（refines）<MATH_0008>。\n<STRUCT_0003> 若<MATH_0009>是标准平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）覆盖（covering），则它重言地（tautologically）等价（equivalent）于<MATH_0010>中的一个覆盖（covering）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 若<MATH_0011>是 Zariski 覆盖（Zariski covering），则它重言地（tautologically）等价（equivalent）于<MATH_0012>中的一个覆盖（covering）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景"},{"source_term":"refines","target_term":"加细"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0003>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"tautologically","target_term":"重言地"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"Zariski covering","target_term":"Zariski 覆盖"},{"source_term":"tautologically","target_term":"重言地"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"景类型，待决"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"景","context":"给定景，待决"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"给定覆盖，待决"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"覆盖关系，待决"},{"source_term":"refines","target_term":"加细","context":"覆盖关系，待决"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0003>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"标准覆盖，待决"},{"source_term":"tautologically","target_term":"重言地","context":"覆盖等价限定，待决"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价","context":"覆盖关系，待决"},{"source_term":"Zarisk