{"unit_id":"tag:03WW:proof","translation":"对每个<MATH_0001>，选择仿射开（affine open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0002>，使得每个<MATH_0003>映入（maps）<MATH_0004>的某个仿射开（affine open）子概形。由引理<REF_0001>，加细（refinement）<MATH_0005>也是平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）覆盖（covering），它覆盖<MATH_0006>。因此，可以假设每个<MATH_0007>都是仿射的（affine），且映入（maps）仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0008>，它属于<MATH_0009>。应用《集合（Sets）》引理<REF_0002>，可知<MATH_0010>同构（isomorphic）于<MATH_0011>的一个对象（object）。但随后，<MATH_0012>作为有限型（finite type）概形（scheme），它在<MATH_0013>上，同构（isomorphic）于对象（object）<MATH_0014>，它属于<MATH_0015>，这是再次应用《集合（Sets）》引理<REF_0003>的结果。覆盖（covering）<MATH_0016>加细（refines）<MATH_0017>（因为它们同构（isomorphic））。此外，<MATH_0018>组合等价（combinatorially equivalent）于覆盖（covering）<MATH_0019>，它是<MATH_0020>在景（site）<MATH_0021>中的覆盖，这由《集合（Sets）》引理<REF_0004>得出。覆盖（covering）<MATH_0022>是 (1) 中所述的加细（refinement）。在 (2)、(3) 的情形中，每个概形（schemes）<MATH_0023>都同构（isomorphic）于<MATH_0024>中的一个对象（object），这由《集合（Sets）》引理<REF_0005>得出；再应用《集合（Sets）》引理<REF_0006>便得到所需结论。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映入"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"加细"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射的"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映入"},{"source_term":"affine open","target_term":"仿射开集"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"Sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"refines","target_term":"加细"},{"source_term":"isomorphic","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"combinatorially eq